      "writtenOn": "2018-07-06T12:48:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is chip-select in SPI. Without this, the slave does not read the data.\n\n\"\n8 SSI: Internal slave select\nThis bit has an effect only when the SSM bit is set. The value of this bit is forced onto the NSS pin and the I/O value of the NSS pin is ignored.\n\"\n\nNSS is active low. Figure 281 from RM0091 is closest to what we actually do (except that we don\u0027t have an external NSS, so we always listen.",
      "parentUuid": "7b9a8f55_013518e0",
